### Page 1 of 6

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 4, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-24-24 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and Traffic Safety Services, Inc. for the 2024 Thermoplastic Markings #1 Project
______________________________________________
Bid #S-24-24 was solicited for the 2024 Thermoplastic Markings #1 (Vicinity Maps Included).

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. S&L Industrial
2. Traffic Safety Services, Inc.

The bids were reviewed by Rick Amen (Engineering), and Tom Cobb (Engineering) and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Traffic Safety Services, Inc.

The total Bid Award is $244,765.00

Project Completion is scheduled for November 29, 2024.

Funding:
020-26-2617-42-21601 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Maintenance)
```

